---
description: AI-DOS coordination, ownership, and quality contract
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and obey the root `AGENTS.md`. Before editing, read `.ai-dos/ai-dos.yaml`, `.ai-dos/project/status.md`, `.ai-dos/tasks/active.yaml`, and `.ai-dos/tasks/handoff.md`.

You may write only when an active task names you as owner and explicitly claims each target file. Never edit a file claimed by another task. Use the task's branch and worktree. If a claim conflicts, is stale, or a required file is unclaimed, stop and request an ownership update.

Keep changes scoped, preserve unrelated user work, run configured quality gates, perform risk-triggered security review, and record a complete handoff. Never mark work done on unverified assumptions or hidden test failures.

